WEBVTT

00:11:29.035 --> 00:11:31.382
against these huge global problems,

00:11:31.382 --> 00:11:33.710
these inequities, to me that was exciting.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:37.444
Yes, the foundation employees had angst about that.

00:11:37.444 --> 00:11:39.119
(Applause)

00:11:39.119 --> 00:11:41.235
CA: That's cool.

00:11:41.235 --> 00:11:42.919
MG: But that went away within three months,

00:11:42.919 --> 00:11:43.846
once he was there.

00:11:43.846 --> 00:11:45.511
BG: Including some of the employees.

00:11:45.511 --> 00:11:46.784
MG: That's what I said, the employees,

00:11:46.784 --> 00:11:48.906
it went away for them three
months after you were there.

00:11:48.906 --> 00:11:51.226
BG: No, I'm kidding.
MG: Oh, you mean, the employees didn't go away.

00:11:51.226 --> 00:11:53.127
BG: A few of them did, but —

00:11:53.127 --> 00:11:54.960
(Laughter)

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.903
CA: So what do you guys argue about?

00:11:56.903 --> 00:11:59.560
Sunday, 11 o'clock,

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:00.981
you're away from work,